{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared STT routing fixture (format frozen by P2-S0; cases owned by P2-C). Read by the Rust router test (speech::router) and the TS mirror test (src/core/services/stt/__tests__/router.test.ts, P2-E).",
    "case = { name, request: RouteRequest, context: RouteContext, expect }. Every expect key is optional: language, tier, streamingModel / finalModel / fallbackModel / languageIdModel (catalog id, or null for 'none'), streamingLanguage (the streaming spec's options.language, null = none), neverModels (ids that must not appear anywhere in the plan), notesInclude (codes that must be in notes), missingInclude (ids that must be in missing). The Rust test rejects unknown keys.",
    "RouteContext fields not given default to false / 0 / empty: 'installed' empty means nothing is installed (every planned id is missing); 'unavailable' empty means every id can be installed; 'physicalCores' 0 means unknown (enough for two passes); 'vramTotalMb' 0 means unknown (no BF16, and a running voice changer keeps the GPU in auto tier).",
    "The seed cases encode the never-route rule 'Cohere is never used for ja / zh / ko / ru' on a GPU PC with everything installed; the rest cover every rule of speech::router (see its module docs and model-catalog/stt-routing.json).",
    "Auto plans also carry the streaming spec's options.streamLanguages (the detected languages the stream may be opened with; never zh / yue). The fixture has no key for it yet (the TS mirror test rejects unknown keys): the Rust router tests check it (auto_streams_only_for_languages_whose_route_streams and the every-request invariants)."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "ja on GPU never routes to Cohere",
      "request": {
        "language": "ja",
        "tier": "gpu",
        "twoPass": true
      },
      "context": {
        "gpu": true,
        "gpuVariant": "cuda13",
        "vramAvailableMb": 16000,
        "vcRunning": false,
        "physicalCores": 8,
        "installed": [
          "stt/cohere-transcribe-q4_k",
          "stt/qwen3-asr-1.7b-q8_0",
          "stt/qwen3-asr-0.6b-int8"
